<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal, AVI withdraw cautionary.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal, AVI withdraw cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd and Anglovaal Industries Ltd on Tuesday withdrew an earlier cautionary notice to shareholders following the termination of unspecified negotiations.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
